2364:
**θυγάτηρ**, -τρός, ἡ
(for use of vocat., cf. M, _Pr._, 71; WH, App, 158), [in LXX for בַּת ([[01-genesis.5.4|Gen.5:4]], al.), exc. [[07-judges.21.14|Jdg.21:14]] B, [[14-2-chronicles.21.17|2Ch.21:17]] (אִשָּׁה ;] 
**daughter**: [[40-matthew.9.18|Mat.9:18 10:35, 37 14:6 15:22, 28]], [[41-mark.5.35|Mrk.5:35 6:22 7:26, 29]], [[42-luke.2.36|Luk.2:36 8:42, 49 12:53]], [[44-acts.2.17|Act.2:17]]" (LXX) [[44-acts.7.21|Act.7:21 21:9]], [[58-hebrews.11.24|Heb.11:24]]. In NT, as in OT, not in cl.; 
