(with) **a measuring reed or rod **(Ez, l.with): [[66-revelation.11.1|Rev.11:1 21:15-16]]; 
(d) **a writing reed, a pen**: [[64-3-john.13.1|III Jn 13]] (cf. Milligan, _NTD_, 9, 7).
